<title>HONG KONG: Chinney Inv interim net rises 15 percent.</title>
<headline>Chinney Inv interim net rises 15 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.8	 vs 8.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0	 vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.04 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    46.34     vs 40.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		     553.19    vs 524.14</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chinney Investments Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 23-27, 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 24, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Chinney Investments engages in garment manufacturing, trading and building construction.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$6.63 million compensation on acquisition of a portion of land by the local authority and HK$3.59 million loss on surrender of a vacant site to the local authority.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
